Files changed from upstream SharpVox for this build (the wasm build has no C++
exceptions, so try/catch/throw and std::stoi/stof/stoll calls were replaced with
exception-free equivalents; behaviour is otherwise the same):
- src/KlattschParser.cpp
- src/DictionaryReader.cpp
- src/KlattSynthesizerFP.cpp
- src/SpeechRenderer.cpp
- src/TextCommands.cpp
- src/Phonemizer.cpp
- platform/lib/SharpVox.cpp
The full diff is in build/sharpvox-jukebox.patch. New file: build/sv_c.cpp
(a small C wrapper exported to JavaScript). The Japanese dictionary is not
included in this build.

No other third-party code is included. The effects, page and loader are
original to this project.
